   "args": {
    "customer_id": "E311",
    "order_id": "K-9101",
    "reason": "restaurant_incident",
    "summary": "Customer received chicken curry instead of tofu curry (item K-9101-1, $14.50) on order K-9101 from Spice Route. Order placed 17:40 on 2026-10-24, within open incident INC-311 (recalled curry sauce batch). Customer has not eaten any of it. Needs compensation via incident team."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
    "follow_up": "within 24 hours"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Omar. I've verified your account and checked order K-9101.\n\nSpice Route has an open incident that covers your order. A curry sauce batch was recalled by their supplier, and your order falls in the affected window. Because of that, I can't issue a refund or credit for the wrong item myself. Our incident team compensates every affected order. I've escalated your case to them, including the wrong-item problem with your tofu curry. A specialist will follow up with you within 24 hours.\n\nSince the curry may involve the recalled sauce, please don't eat it. If you have any symptoms or health concerns, tell me and I'll flag them right away."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, so I won't be able to get a refund from you directly, and someone else will follow up within 24 hours. Will I still get my money back for the curry, or is that not guaranteed?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I can't promise the outcome. The incident team decides the compensation, and I can't tell you what they'll offer. The incident notes say the team is contacting and compensating every affected order, and your order is covered by the incident. So you should be hearing from them. A specialist will follow up within 24 hours.\n\nI can't issue anything on this order myself while the incident is open. Is there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I understand. I'll wait to hear from the specialist. I haven't eaten any of the chicken curry, and I feel fine. Thanks for your help."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Omar. I'm glad you feel fine. Please keep the curry uneaten until the specialist contacts you. If anything changes with your health, contact us right away. Have a good evening."
  }
